  description: "Each time a \"Yosenju\" monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned,
    place 1 Yosen Counter on this card. You can remove any number of Yosen Counters
    from this card; apply this effect, depending on the number of Yosen Counters
    removed. You can only use this effect of \"Yosen Training Grounds\" once per
    turn.\n\u25CF 1 Counter: All \"Yosenju\" monsters you currently control gain
    300 ATK until the end of this turn (even if this card leaves the field).\n\u25CF
    3 Counters: Add 1 \"Yosenju\" card from your Deck or Graveyard to your hand."
